notes:        Generated from scratch by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026, driven by the generator in `tests/fixtures/tools/` (one composition per case, named like the case; tests/fixtures/CASES.md), as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The XMP packet after the project container was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project.
